      "cooked": "<p>An odd question, but I tend to ask those… Maybe it’s just my copy, but the art and background on all of my copies of Darken the Sky are pixelated. By background I mean the word balloon down at the bottom, the polka dot design next to the word balloon, and the red-orange background of the “One-Shot” box is just ever-so-slightly exceeding its box at the bottom. The back of the card is fine; just the front.</p>\n<p>Anyone else’s copy have a similar problem? I can scan an image of my card if that’d help explain better.</p>",
